  "goodToKnow": "Lancieren means to launch a product, campaign or initiative: eine Kampagne lancieren. It's especially common in Switzerland, where a Volksinitiative is lanciert. It also means to leak or plant information strategically: eine Meldung in die Presse lancieren. From French lancer (to throw). Pronounced with a French nasal. Participle: lanciert."
